4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清平乐","author":"孙云凤","text":"留春不住。\n一任春归去。\n门外马嘶芳草路。\n花落子规啼处。\n陌头柳色青青。\n丝丝欲绾离情。\n闲却鸳鸯绣谱，画屏独背银灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":22310,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆秦娥 立夏寄仙品","author":"孙云凤","text":"人天末。\n绿肥红瘦和谁说。\n和谁说。\n故乡樱笋，他乡风月。\n闲庭春去愁还结。\n脆圆荐酒酴醾节。\n酴醾节。\n此时此景，一般伤别。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":22311,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]